SUMMARY:VALLEY OF THE SUN (us) + SUNSTAIN (aut) (Uhrzeit prüfen)
LOCATION:Arena
DESCRIPTION:Roadtrip To Outta Space | Arena Wien - Dreiraum | Valley Of The Sun is a three-piece Rock band formed in 2010.  With a unique blend of Stoner Rock\, Grunge\, and Psychedelia\, their sound has been compared to the likes of Fu Manchu\, Kyuss\, Truckfighters and Soundgarden.  Celebrating the release of their latest album\, "Quintessence"\, they are currently on a three month tour spanning the USA\, UK and Europe.  Their captivating performances are often riffy\, occasionally serene\, and always LOUD\, and their take-no-prisoners attitude always leaves their fans wanting more.   https://valleyofthesun.bandcamp.com/  The Linz‑based band Sunstain has been an integral part of the Austrian underground rock scene since 2017. Constantly evolving through stoner rock\, alternative\, grunge\, progressive rock\, and doom\, they refuse to be confined to a single genre and embrace experimenting with a wide range of influences. The best way to experience Sunstain is to witness one of their powerful and captivating live performances. www.sunstain.at  Vorverkauf/Presale € 20 (+ € 2\,20) Abendkassa/Box-office tba.
URL:https://arena.wien/Home/Programm-Detail/concert-id/48574
